[make 5] [drop 5] -> 5 | an init's borrowed parameter
[make 2] [make 1] [drop 1] [drop 2] -> 21 | two parameters: made in order, dropped newest first, at the statement's end
-> 100 | an init taking the literal as it is wins; nothing is made
[make 4] -> 4 [drop 4] | the implicit init moves a W in; it lives with its owner
[make 2] [drop 2] -> 2 [make 2] [drop 2] -> 2 | each pass of a loop
